# ARC-0008 stage 3 (level 5): Peripeteia, Convene the Court + King's Hand, Lord Commander, Master of Healing.
# Spec: 50_ENGINEERING/55_Implementation_Specs/SPEC_ARC-0008.md (stage 3). Applied with
#   perl 80_TOOLS_AND_PIPELINE/82_Automation/stats/stats_add.pl <this> --apply      ([fechado] ARC-0008)
# No `using`: every field is written (the Owner's rule since stage 1). Look fields copied from the named vanilla spell.
# Numbers: 25.01/SPL_Kingmaker_Peripeteia (level 3, 18 m, once per combat), 25.02/FEAT_Kingmaker_Court (3 m),
# 25.02/FEAT_Kingmaker_TheRota (crit threshold 1).

@loca KM_PERIPETEIA_NAME Peripeteia
@loca KM_PERIPETEIA_DESC Reverse the fortunes of every creature on the Wheel within [1].
@loca KM_PERIPETEIA_EXTRA Reigning becomes Fallen and Rising becomes Falling, and the reverse. Your allies turn too.<br><br>Once per combat.
@loca KM_CONVENE_NAME Convene the Court
@loca KM_CONVENE_DESC Name your Court. Each ally you appoint holds an office until your next <LSTag Tooltip="LongRest">Long Rest</LSTag>.
@loca KM_CONVENE_EXTRA You can appoint as many offices as your Charisma <LSTag Tooltip="AbilityModifier">Modifier</LSTag>, at least one. You can't hold an office yourself, and an ally holds one office at most.
@loca KM_OFFICE_EXTRA The office lasts until your next <LSTag Tooltip="LongRest">Long Rest</LSTag>. Each office can be given once per <LSTag Tooltip="LongRest">Long Rest</LSTag>.
@loca KM_KINGS_HAND_NAME King's Hand
@loca KM_KINGS_HAND_STATUS Serves as the King's Hand. While no ally is Reigning, wears the crown and lands a <LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit">Critical Hit</LSTag> on a roll of 19 or 20.
@loca KM_KINGS_HAND_SPELL Appoint an ally as the King's Hand. While no ally is Reigning, it wears the crown and lands a <LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit">Critical Hit</LSTag> on a roll of 19 or 20.
@loca KM_LORD_COMMANDER_NAME Lord Commander
@loca KM_LORD_COMMANDER_STATUS Guards the crown. <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> against the King have <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> while the King is within [1].
@loca KM_LORD_COMMANDER_SPELL Appoint an ally as Lord Commander. While the King is within [1] of it, <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> against the King have <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag>.
@loca KM_MASTER_OF_HEALING_NAME Master of Healing
@loca KM_MASTER_OF_HEALING_STATUS Healing an ally on the Wheel lifts it one position closer to Reigning, if it is Fallen or Rising.
@loca KM_MASTER_OF_HEALING_SPELL Appoint an ally as Master of Healing. When it heals an ally on the Wheel that is Fallen or Rising, that ally moves one position closer to Reigning.
@loca KM_GUARDED_NAME Guarded
@loca KM_GUARDED_DESC The Lord Commander stands guard. <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> against it have <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag>.

